    "detailed_description": "The first hotel simulator to take you behind the scenes of idyllic holidays. Your mission is to provide unforgettable memories for guests while managing your hotel and growing your business!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Build your dream hotel </strong></h2> Choose the ideal location, design and build all the facilities required (reception, restaurants, suites\u2026), and decorate them to suit your tastes. <br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Pamper your guests! </strong></h2>  Pick up your guests from the harbour and make sure their entire stay is as comfortable as possible to gain the best online reviews. Cleaning, storage, transportation, food, entertainment: all aspects of their holiday are your responsibility.<br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Manage your establishment and staff </strong></h2>  As the manager, you have many responsibilities: hiring staff, organizing tasks to be done in the hotel, handling reservations, preparing menus, optimising profits, investing in new equipment\u2026 Your decisions will determine the success of your business!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The first hotel simulator to take you behind the scenes of idyllic holidays. Your mission is to provide unforgettable memories for guests while managing your hotel and growing your business!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Build your dream hotel </strong></h2> Choose the ideal location, design and build all the facilities required (reception, restaurants, suites\u2026), and decorate them to suit your tastes. <br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Pamper your guests! </strong></h2>  Pick up your guests from the harbour and make sure their entire stay is as comfortable as possible to gain the best online reviews. Cleaning, storage, transportation, food, entertainment: all aspects of their holiday are your responsibility.<br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Manage your establishment and staff </strong></h2>  As the manager, you have many responsibilities: hiring staff, organizing tasks to be done in the hotel, handling reservations, preparing menus, optimising profits, investing in new equipment\u2026 Your decisions will determine the success of your business!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You are the manager of a hotel in an idyllic location. Build, design and develop your hotel, while creating unforgettable memories for your guests through expert management and by offering exceptional entertainment.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Thai, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
